==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Celestial Storm|Celesteela|100}} from the {{TCG|Celestial Storm}} expansion.
*The '''Moombahton''' attack is named after {{wp|moombahton}}, a genre of music. The name as written in katakana contains ムーン, which is homophonous to ''Moon''. {{p|Celesteela}}'s design is a possible reference to Princess Kaguya from ''{{wp|The Tale of the Bamboo Cutter}}'', a mythical character that hailed from the Moon; and the Pokémon is exclusive to {{pkmn|Sun and Moon|Pokémon Moon}} and {{pkmn|Ultra Sun and Ultra Moon|Ultra Moon}}.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Ultra Sun}}.

